  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business Innovation Facility (BIF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to help the poor by creating jobs, raising incomes or delivering welfare benefits to consumers.  It will support 340,000 poor people in Nigeria, Malawi, Burma and other priority counties by improving the performance and inclusiveness of key market systems on which they depend.</narrative>
  </description>
